@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor "Client" as Client
participant "HistoryView\n(UI)" as UI
participant "OrderService\n(Backend)" as Service
participant "OrderRepository\n(DB)" as DB

Client -> UI : Navigate to Order History view
UI -> Service : getOrdersForUser(user.getId())
activate Service

Service -> DB : findByUserId(userId)
activate DB
DB --> Service : return List<Order>
deactivate DB

Service --> UI : return historical orders collection
deactivate Service

Note over UI: Bind order items into Grid view component\nshowing dates, totals, and scores

UI -> Client : Populate grid with user purchase history
@enduml